- `<DL>` — bookmark folder lists.
- `<DT>` — bookmark/folder records.
- `<H3>` — folder headings.
- `<A HREF>` — bookmark URLs.
- `ADD_DATE`
- `LAST_MODIFIED`
- Optional icon attributes.
- HTML entities.
- Unicode text.
- Nested folder structures.

Use a suitable maintained HTML parser.

Do not rely on simplistic regular expressions to parse arbitrary nested HTML.

Treat all imported HTML as untrusted data.

